{title: 649 - Lord, While for All Mankind We Pray}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #649 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 649}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Lord, while [C]for [F]all [Bb]man[C]kind we [F]pray, Of [Bb]ev[C]ery [G]clime and [C]coast,
[C]Oh, [F]hear us [Bb]for [F]our [Gm]na[F]tive [C]land, [F]The [C]land [Dm]we [Gm7]love [C]the [F]most!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F][C]O [F]guard [Bb][C]our [F]shores [Bb][C]from [G]every [C]foe,
[C][F][Bb]With [F][Gm][F]peace [C][F]our [C][Dm][Gm7]borders [C][F]bless;
[F][C]With [F][Bb]prosperous [C]times [F][Bb]our [C][G]cities [C]crown,
[C][F][Bb][F]Our [Gm][F][C]fields [F][C][Dm]with [Gm7][C][F]plenteousness!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F][C]Unite [F][Bb]us [C]in [F][Bb]the [C][G]sacred [C]love
[C][F][Bb]Of [F][Gm][F]knowledge, [C][F]truth, [C][Dm][Gm7]and [C][F]Thee;
[F][C]And [F]let [Bb][C]our [F]hills [Bb][C]and [G]valleys [C]shout
[C][F][Bb][F]The [Gm][F][C]songs [F][C][Dm]of [Gm7][C][F]liberty.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F][C]Lord [F]of [Bb][C]the [F]nations, [Bb][C]thus [G]to [C]Thee
[C][F][Bb][F]Our [Gm][F][C]country [F][C][Dm]we [Gm7][C][F]commend;
[F][C]Be [F]Thou [Bb][C]her [F]Refuge [Bb][C]and [G]her [C]trust,
[C][F][Bb][F][Gm]Her [F][C][F][C]everlasting [Dm][Gm7][C][F]friend.
{end_of_verse}
